// Bytecode - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# Bytecode is machine code for a virtual machine. There is no
# single format under this name; this file carries the payload
# a loader would interpret to produce "Hello World!".
48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C 64 21
